  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Peru Support Group - Information and Advocacy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PSG works in order to influence UK policy on Peru, provide reliable and updated information to a constituency in the UK and fosters links between a wide range of CSOs, NGOs, and GOs in Peru and the UK. The PSG has chosen as its key themes: Poverty, rights and people development; deepening democracy and governance; corporate responsibility and extractive industries.</narrative>
  </description>
